{"slug":"Leetcode-134-Gas-Station","title":"Leetcode#134. Gas Station","date":"2024-09-10","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","Array","Greedy","💡"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"There are gas stations along a circular route, where the amount of gas at the station is . You have a car with an unlimited gas tank and it costs of gas to travel from the station to its next station.","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>There are <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span> gas stations along a circular route, where the amount of gas at the <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>ith</span></span></code></span> station is <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>gas[i]</span></span></code></span>.</p>\n<p>You have a car with an unlimited gas tank and it costs <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>cost[i]</span></span></code></span> of gas to travel from the <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>ith</span></span></code></span> station to its next <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>(i + 1)th</span></span></code></span> station. You begin the journey with an empty tank at one of the gas stations.</p>\n<p>Given two integer arrays <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>gas</span></span></code></span> and <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>cost</span></span></code></span>, return <em>the starting gas station's index if you can travel around the circuit once in the clockwise direction, otherwise return</em> <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-1</span></span></code></span>. If there exists a solution, it is <strong>guaranteed</strong> to be <strong>unique</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: gas = [1,2,3,4,5], cost = [3,4,5,1,2]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Start at station 3 (index 3) and fill up with 4 unit of gas. Your tank = 0 + 4 = 4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 4. Your tank = 4 - 1 + 5 = 8</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 0. Your tank = 8 - 2 + 1 = 7</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 1. Your tank = 7 - 3 + 2 = 6</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 2. Your tank = 6 - 4 + 3 = 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 3. The cost is 5. Your gas is just enough to travel back to station 3.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Therefore, return 3 as the starting index.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: gas = [2,3,4], cost = [3,4,3]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: -1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>You can't start at station 0 or 1, as there is not enough gas to travel to the next station.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Let's start at station 2 and fill up with 4 unit of gas. Your tank = 0 + 4 = 4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 0. Your tank = 4 - 3 + 2 = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Travel to station 1. Your tank = 3 - 3 + 3 = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>You cannot travel back to station 2, as it requires 4 unit of gas but you only have 3.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Therefore, you can't travel around the circuit once no matter where you start.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n == gas.length == cost.length</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= n &#x3C;= 105</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>0 &#x3C;= gas[i], cost[i] &#x3C;= 104</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"解\"><a href=\"#解\">解</a></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> canCompleteCircuit</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">gas</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(gas) </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(cost):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">        # 否則應能順利跑完 重點!</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        start </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(gas) ) :</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> gas[i]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">cost[i]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                start </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"> #</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> start</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"錯誤紀錄\"><a href=\"#錯誤紀錄\">錯誤紀錄</a></h3>\n<p>超過時間外，當相減==0沒判決成功</p>\n<p>ex: [0,0] [0,0]</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> canCompleteCircuit</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">gas</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        fill </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [ a</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a,b </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(gas,cost) ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fill) </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fill) ):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fill) ):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                cur </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (i</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">j)</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">%</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fill))</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> fill[cur]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> tank </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    break</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fill) </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span></code></pre></figure>"}